+
+## Client-side navigation
+
+Pages use Astro's `ClientRouter`. On top of it, `src/scripts/view-cache.ts` keeps previously visited page views alive inside `main[data-view-host]` (hidden with `content-visibility: hidden` and `inert`) instead of rebuilding them, so navigating back to a recent page is near-instant. The header, footer and ad slots persist across navigations. At most six inactive views are kept (least recently used are evicted); reloading the current URL and form submissions always render fresh content.
